Output docs/media/rebase.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1640
Set Height 820
Set Padding 14
Set Margin 22
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 24
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env GITPAD_LOGO text
Hide
Type 'cd "$GITPAD_DEMO" && git stash -u -q; clear && gitpad' Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "i"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "r"
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+U
Type "feat(api): streaming TTS proxy (v2)"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "k"
Sleep 300ms
Type "s"
Sleep 800ms
Screenshot docs/screenshots/rebase.png
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "q"
Sleep 200ms
Type "q"
Sleep 400ms
